    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώλῡ-σις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prevention</i>, 
